1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
David was a senior manager at a big logistics firm.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
He was known for always answering emails within minutes,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
even at dinner, even at midnight.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
He took pride in being reliable,

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
but his family often saw more of the top of his head

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
than his eyes.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
One Saturday, while reviewing a report at home,

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
David ignored a call from his mother.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
I'll call her back tonight, he mumbled, not looking up.

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
That evening, his sister called instead with news.

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Their mom had suffered a minor stroke.

12
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
She was OK but shaken.

13
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,000
She said she just wanted to hear your voice, his sister added.

14
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
David sat in silence.

15
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
That small sentence hit harder than any business failure

16
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,000
he'd ever faced.

17
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
The next day, David visited his mom,

18
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
sat with her for hours, and didn't check his phone once.

19
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,000
On his drive home, he thought about everything

20
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,000
he'd postponed.

21
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Family dinners, weekends away, quiet mornings with his kids,

22
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
all traded for meetings he couldn't even remember.

23
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Monday, he talked to his boss.

24
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,000
I'm restructuring my schedule, he said.

25
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,000
I'll still deliver, but I won't be available 24-7.

26
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,000
To his surprise, his boss nodded.

27
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Good, she said.

28
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,000
We should all do that.

